\f1 \b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 This protocol is implemented by objects in the responder chain that can correct a misspelled word. See the description of the NSSpellChecker class for more information.\
\fs14\
